@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Design lifecycle and feedback
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Understand current requirements and analysis contracts;
:Choose architecture and refine component design;
:Define focused verification and compatibility needs;
:Implement only the authorized bounded scope;
repeat
:Verify actual candidate and affected behavior;
if (Evidence insufficient?) then (yes)
 :Inspect finding and revise design or refactor;
endif
repeat while (Evidence insufficient?) is (yes) not (no)
:Record actual disposition and remaining limits;
:Feed new evidence into subsequent design work;
stop

@enduml